# NodeRings Provider

[NodeRings](https://noderings.com) is a marketplace for infrastructure from independent hosting providers. This provider manages: virtual machines and their add-ons, firewalls, hosted DNS, SSH keys and access control, plus lookups of marketplace offers, the catalog and billing.

